### Severity Levels
| Level | Meaning |
|-------|---------|
| 🔴 CRITICAL | Missing core requirement, wrong logic, data integrity risk |
| 🟡 WARNING | Ambiguous requirement, missing edge case, incomplete criteria |
| 🟢 INFO | Suggestion or optimization, deferrable |

